OCPARTICLE 2
NAME Celebrate
# A burst of golden sparkles for a finished lap and the finish line (AN_SpawnParticlesAt). Self-lit, additive, SPAWNAT on.
EMITTER Sparkle
SIM auto
SHAPE sphere 40
BLEND additive
EMISSION 0 40 1024
LIFETIME 0.9 1.8
DIRECTION 0 0 1 70
SPEED 300 900
GRAVITY 0 0 -520
DAMPING 0.1
SIZE 7 1
COLOR start 1 0.85 0.3 1
COLOR end 1 0.3 0.1 0
SPRITE camera
SORT none
LIGHTING unlit
FOG on
SPAWNAT on
BOUNDS 1500
